                <l xml:id="m-2977cd0b-a5f4-4561-b46e-60a9b99b7096" facs="#m-7b56f54f-a68e-4c4a-81db-d7737ab52130" label="text-like">St. John, Apostle and Evangelist.</l><l xml:id="m-a6971102-095e-4097-9463-c6ecd14a4419" facs="#m-9a72fba4-541f-47de-b4df-4321daac3037" label="ambiguous">423</l><l xml:id="m-a6632a5c-5e89-4322-83be-a20f0859edf7" facs="#m-2031e1d2-9b03-43b7-b848-c89a8e358c75" label="lyrics-like">qui testimó¬</l><l xml:id="m-575f504c-d0b3-4110-8003-a2d0e1f04510" facs="#m-665ba81f-f377-43e2-9697-6b9d28836f81" label="ambiguous">le,</l><l xml:id="m-88cbc8d2-f5f8-4316-b487-6100b9ae9d69" facs="#m-ca1b7532-f146-4141-aebe-5dc1261aac54" label="ambiguous">est</l><l xml:id="m-e6c15cb3-c5ea-40d6-808f-350a15f569a6" facs="#m-3b695a29-a75d-40cc-9988-3df8e97a5c21" label="lyrics-like">discípulus î¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4352eb4-b688-43af-bdba-2deb613c5f45" facs="#m-a4c7de94-9325-4e47-948c-74afd22b2466" label="lyrics-like">ni-um pérhi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d969db0-ae37-4831-99b4-dc4b4482da1b" facs="#m-782a1c97-48fe-47ca-99a2-68460878bf41" label="lyrics-like">his : et scí¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ee77b66-9940-45c3-98f8-a0c10d714bfe" facs="#m-2be02383-567c-49e3-acda-5a28a20105e3" label="ambiguous">bet de</l><l xml:id="m-26fbc729-8d86-4cd9-8159-25761930c2f0" facs="#m-2f492e0a-a352-4f6d-861c-bf7de009e2bc" label="lyrics-like">qui-a vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1c9da20-426c-4669-9b33-f8e739cc2d73" facs="#m-da29e676-f2a7-4826-968d-a4d49654c97f" label="ambiguous">mus</l><l xml:id="m-d0eda443-15d0-4f88-9a83-fc0d52614963" facs="#m-611a70e6-f4c9-4ff1-86f0-b1e0550b72e5" label="lyrics-like">rum est te-stimóni-um</l><l xml:id="m-1c7a1166-78cd-4b3d-bf2e-80e144c7624a" facs="#m-8a056b4b-c08c-42c4-9fee-8c80e93ac4bb" label="lyrics-like">*é- jus.</l><l xml:id="m-8b8a6cc0-499f-4cdf-96cf-69fee4c08e39" facs="#m-f4bae1a3-a2dc-4cf1-8b4f-e293a042c63a" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 2r. d.</l><l xml:id="m-d2cbf1dc-ff30-4dc5-8f9f-860d2f2c8d50" facs="#m-00d139ce-cb4c-4c79-bb8e-bb7257543236" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus Petro: tu me séquere. Exiit ergo sermo</l><l xml:id="m-6ada78ed-c8dc-434d-a7d4-efcb7111ae9e" facs="#m-9490e31b-dc6c-4913-8d8e-99bb8717fa9a" label="lyrics-like">1 Séquere me. Convérsus Petrus</l><l xml:id="m-0d9132d7-f15e-4724-808b-e52b09fb1c97" facs="#m-e54a1c6b-5ee7-4a04-88fe-6959f4a1e0a0" label="lyrics-like">iste inter fratres, quia discípulus</l><l xml:id="m-fa7245c4-12a5-4269-b062-b367fc072d02" facs="#m-2ec89921-1ee2-4b7f-815b-f2099d2bd87f" label="lyrics-like">ille non móritur. Et non dixit ei</l><l xml:id="m-e80ac662-481f-4fda-88b9-ee559c38be2d" facs="#m-b7af8fee-ae32-4cb0-b644-1a5b6dee39e0" label="ambiguous">vidit illum discipulum, quem dili¬</l><l xml:id="m-9aeef8ba-911a-4105-9a31-e014158372dd" facs="#m-ba05fcc9-71d5-498a-bedd-3fbc0a7d11ff" label="lyrics-like">gébat Jesus, sequéntem, qui et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-068f31d9-5cb2-4cdf-90bd-b2954c4d598b" facs="#m-36484a2f-5d9c-42a9-8e35-d79cef3d09d1" label="lyrics-like">Jesus: Non móritur; sed : Sic eum</l><l xml:id="m-df06d8ff-7422-4ef0-8283-afcbae75c37c" facs="#m-8b8eb471-59d7-4344-a10a-b67a4288dc45" label="lyrics-like">volo manére, donec véniam, quid</l><l xml:id="m-30674953-9b40-4be2-9333-c5c86d365711" facs="#m-329305f8-13c0-4ad3-8992-564a6d4bdb01" label="lyrics-like">cúbuit in coena super pectus ejus,</l><l xml:id="m-390d4bed-b3ea-4109-861b-e5e90fa65ec7" facs="#m-7fc6580a-31a2-47da-8ee2-a99beefc7ebc" label="ambiguous">ad te? Hic est discipulus ille, qui</l><l xml:id="m-770b9dce-75e0-4099-80b7-dc7ab306929f" facs="#m-34096251-90ef-429f-9916-7eac60d694f7" label="lyrics-like">et dixit : Dómine, quis est qui tradet</l><l xml:id="m-b65e2e48-fee4-4d95-8cac-47dd206fa3d8" facs="#m-0b8ff883-ddaa-43f6-9b00-1e740f3da21d" label="lyrics-like">testimónium pérhibet de his, et scri¬</l><l xml:id="m-bad91205-0ce6-4511-a893-25a2fe06eac8" facs="#m-1b950abe-00e6-4f75-b3bc-eac14d6599e3" label="ambiguous">te? Hunc ergo cum vidisset Petrus,</l><l xml:id="m-5869646b-f81c-4fcc-9d75-77259a8299cc" facs="#m-8e438fa2-45e3-4e6d-a7b4-c0239399df71" label="lyrics-like">dixit Jesu: Dómine, hic autem</l><l xml:id="m-4ab44e9b-cbe3-4b0d-b0dd-dcede23cf4a0" facs="#m-9a3e2ef0-b726-4c2e-ac59-f0dba711301f" label="ambiguous">psit haec: et scimus, quia verum</l><l xml:id="m-e1662524-2965-4bfd-bdde-2fa03ce7ac3c" facs="#m-eebab288-0448-4397-bb3d-88cad0e492b2" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-1b7b786b-61a0-405c-a647-c09b424df12c" facs="#m-0e09e57e-d50f-4578-aa30-181c379ed4b3" label="ambiguous">quid? Dicit ei Jesus: Sic eum volo</l><l xml:id="m-cf4eabb1-d094-47bd-8915-ce1e8a655dbb" facs="#m-62c3384f-e6d9-4f90-9462-84dc9c0e3061" label="lyrics-like">est testimónium ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-2bf7cd4a-593d-4a74-a9c8-403132a6db00" facs="#m-b78c795f-b6b4-4728-8ac2-87c9311a0425" label="lyrics-like">manére, donec véniam, quid ad te?</l><l xml:id="m-422c7ed2-abbc-453e-b8a2-3158da96267f" facs="#m-aa6434ad-ee52-4153-94ca-3073e20ae490" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Jústus ut pálma. from the Common of Doctors, p. 1193.</l><l xml:id="m-e35b3481-d3e5-4e3e-9b7a-70bb51e67588" facs="#m-730eb705-61b4-4037-a0cd-74fe29a58acd" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-9977c347-ad88-4f95-a7cb-60840776b359" facs="#m-78eaf8c3-e389-4f1f-b2b7-cb45eb968aae" label="lyrics-like">YUscipe Dómine múnera, quae mus, cujus nos confidimus patroci¬</l><l xml:id="m-520787bb-30c6-4a73-a66a-cbcc686839ba" facs="#m-a6a69c87-19e4-431a-820b-0fe152ec260b" label="lyrics-like">O in ejus tibi solemnitáte deféri-l nio liberári. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d233c3e4-165d-497d-a06f-d5ffc6aead50" facs="#m-c5f22673-f20c-4b70-abbf-169aad11303a" label="lyrics-like">Secret of the Nativity. Obláta Dómine. p. 410.</l><l xml:id="m-ca40440b-0524-45ca-b11c-ad4d5d2eadb6" facs="#m-d15bcb3a-34e4-4219-bd49-d5921ef42fa8" label="text-like">Preface of the Nativity, p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-01eeab3a-02ed-41eb-8de4-077aa9e8f946" facs="#m-2b667790-b033-4919-9824-38e640858725" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-e1d10dec-245f-4b6d-b7f9-ae85825aabca" facs="#m-7b18b4e9-23c3-4a23-8ffe-dcbe52ba550a" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-26324c01-2157-41ef-85f0-01ebcee68f7a" facs="#m-8084567e-237b-4624-94f2-a63eb49c6b79" label="lyrics-like">X-i- it“ sérmo inter frá-tres. quod discípulus</l><l xml:id="m-2935e552-3bd4-4f28-9ee6-eb7346ca6383" facs="#m-f8fdb3b5-24d6-4c73-aa71-bff9512aacc5" label="lyrics-like">Non mó¬</l><l xml:id="m-f255d498-193b-4266-9dcf-4cb4b1b18c0a" facs="#m-5f91a4f0-4ad0-46e3-9760-0242f2ad08c9" label="lyrics-like">flle non mó-ri-tur: et non dí-xit Jésus:</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>